<title>USA: Noel sells HealthPlan stock to ADP.</title>
<headline>Noel sells HealthPlan stock to ADP.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noel Group Inc said Friday it sold 1.32 million common shares of its holding in HealthPlan Services Corp to Automatic Data Processing Inc for $20 a share, or $26.4 million.</p>
<p>Noel, a holding company for small and medium-sized companies, said the shares it sold represented nine percent of HealthPlan's outstanding common stock and the deal cut its stake in HealthPlan to about 29 percent.</p>
